  "examples": [
    {
      "coptic": "ⲙⲙⲁⲧⲟⲓ ϭⲉ ⲁⲩϫⲓϣⲟϫⲛⲉ ⲉϩⲉⲧⲃ ⲛⲉⲧⲙⲏⲣ . ⲙⲏⲡⲱⲥ ⲛⲧⲉⲟⲩⲁ **ⲛⲏⲏⲃⲉ** ⲛϥⲣⲃⲟⲗ .",
      "english": "The soldiers' counsel was to kill the prisoners, so that none of them would swim out and escape.",
      "source": "44_Acts of the Apostles_27",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.acts.sahidica:27",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲗⲗⲁ ⲙⲉⲣⲉⲛ**ⲛⲏⲏⲃⲉ** ϣⲟⲩⲟ ⲉϩⲣⲁⲓ ⲙⲡⲁⲩⲉⲓⲛ ⲉⲧⲃⲉⲡⲁϣⲁⲓ ⲛⲛⲧⲏⲩ ⲛⲧⲁⲩⲉⲓ ⲉϫⲱⲟⲩ .",
      "english": "but the sailors don't empty out the cargo because of the multitude of winds that come against them.",
